sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Patient as Citizen Patient / Doctor
    participant App as PRANA Patient App
    participant API as PRANA Document Service
    participant R2 as Cloudflare R2 Object Storage
    participant Gemini as Google Gemini 2.0 Flash Vision
    participant DB as Supabase PostgreSQL

    Patient->>App: Select Prescription Photo / Lab PDF from Device
    App->>API: POST /api/documents/upload-intent (filename, file_size, mime_type)
    API-->>App: Presigned S3-Compatible Upload URL
    App->>R2: Direct Binary PUT (Presigned Upload to R2 Bucket)
    R2-->>App: HTTP 200 OK (Object Stored)
    
    App->>API: POST /api/ai/summarize (document_url, mime_type)
    API->>R2: Fetch Document Stream
    R2-->>API: Return Image/PDF Buffer
    API->>API: Base64 Encode Buffer & Build Clinical Extraction Prompt
    API->>Gemini: POST generateContent (Multimodal Vision Prompt)
    Gemini-->>API: Returns Structured JSON (Diagnoses, Rx List, Vitals, Key Warning)
    
    API->>DB: INSERT into medical_records (user_id, document_url, ai_summary, title)
    DB-->>API: Record ID & Timestamp
    API-->>App: Summarization Completed (JSON Payload)
    App-->>Patient: Render Interactive Card with Extracted Medications & Dosages
